## AVAILABLE COMMANDS

- `./run build` - build the project
- `./run test` - run the tests
- `./run lint` - run the linter
- `./run format` - format the code
- `./run dev` - build and run the project in the iPhone 14(iOS 16) simulator
- `./run check` - run the linter, build and test
- `./run clean` - clean the build artifacts
- `./run logs` - show the device logs
- `./run help` - show the help